The Two Popes is a drama, history film directed by Fernando Meirelles.

3
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:56,000
Frustrated with the direction of the church, Cardinal Bergoglio
requests permission to retire in 2012 from Pope Benedict.

4
00:27:46,666 --> 00:27:52,666
Instead, facing scandal and self-doubt, the introspective Pope Benedict summons his harshest critic and future
successor to Rome to reveal a secret that would shake the foundations of the Catholic Church.

